    "AmigaOS 3.2 Workbench and IPrefs"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Owns the saved shared Workbench and TextEdit preferences, their saved project icons, two background images, and the legacy UNPacker preferences file. The installed UNP.prefs remains present without a bundled UNPacker command.",
    "Stock startup links RAM:ENV to ENVARC. The Workbench pattern preferences and Copper-Demon's optional preset refer to the shared Copper_32C+.iff. ClassicWB OS39 supplies this exact ILBM as Copper16x16.iff. Window_Background.iff retains its checked BCWB bytes.",
    "Palette.prefs is the native OS preference stream. FullPalette owns its separate fullpalette.prefs and presets. WBDock retains its own background and active profile. AmigaOS supplies the preferences editors and TextEdit executable."
  ],
